{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1579,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "55de4ce263af14817647562a7fd0854a4cb17a23",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad29d1e7dac5a5267981116",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "棋步推进得很顺畅呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c139d59e3cdd17dfade9548595e6cbfabea3bcadc6c01d495069bb6662da3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e117736e811d6fac4561c9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的战术绝不存在极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a821fe8e1e13319b7111eadf3f1e739368541770546b81c83a97f6d71978d81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399b67e66992a2acd33e06bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是统治地位。来吧，开始游戏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d8d06791db9b5cf89335c58472f14399182c335deb8ef8f8adc531240a2bdc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67dcec2633f7242e827d05a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盘面尽在我掌中――\r\n看我华丽地支配全场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c8b3ea23296f2bae19ad9e00b619a4c31ac3a075dc8c6807d4e2f11ac04a00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed09283cb5bcc69c9de24ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新阶段的帷幕拉开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbde2f111b015868fdd248d7f87e7ae8ffb7a3201efc98ced0e6a4ae333eea2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1145",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:229347af824aea1e24d47df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e503174d4061b5a441fdf881cb3104cb5ae97793c7d54f43b96980f665783a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9d884e59f4f826256e8150",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既会向晚辈请求拜师，\r\n又会提出些出人意料的建议……\r\n呵……你这人还真是，意外地不拘一格啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "306dbb7f8551d7f2e0cac1a4a1fe9576a089d9eb26bac2640cd7b0fc730f25fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fff1dd5d1e6b532a2f1c7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4026e1daa1529c49aebd2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a7895ea085883f1886d6640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还有不少稚嫩之处……但你\r\n很有潜力。……这把薙刀的保养，\r\n说不定以后还会交给你呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab90b4fe874ad11bcb7051abf5ad2683ad08f4063482cc73ef6e22bb98a3c90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2505daa2f2cc6a5fa118ccd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼——越是那些不畏苦难、向阳而生，\r\n不断向上伸展的嫩芽……\r\n才越有让人默默守护的价值啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "186f6ebe5dbf01000ab5390ee548992e1fb5ff4568648a8f82a12a80b21d7f18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2d8a7fa68c2d504b5b4711",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n我稍后要去俱乐部打声招呼。\r\n你也一起来吧。大家都在等你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f1b812a2a8144a171799a17ed952fd570db8e1adc41fe591b735b3dd10d6af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b05c249ffc1f9e669fa7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能借用一下训练员室的\r\n冰箱吗？我收到了巧克力……\r\n不想让大家的心意融化掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c665274400df6206a4a0057b3fedf25d5657e62d1abb230de3b8b3dad24861cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a289fe6157c509a0a10478b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本想送些点心……但如果是花的话，\r\n能更长久地治愈你吧？\r\n……况且蝴蝶兰尤其不易枯萎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b6d82a304f9d88c29af91e44de2538d9e5fa2348eaf6be8dd7b54ab3f6675ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aceab25f9feda845f861e3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直接仰望夜空固然好……但偶尔，\r\n也试着看看水镜中倒映的星空吧。\r\n那随风摇曳的银河别有一番风味哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e111ffc07980d53d7512a00010865537c464a880d1785bdcc9945dc1bda233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9cbf3caaec2373096d6bec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋？\r\n哦……打算对为师恶作剧吗\r\n——有气魄。我接受你的挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36051ba884e08012159eb1a512fc6a1ad49813306d8e3542ee65a277859a7e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec3bfbd6c08ca076b90e7591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自幼便没什么物欲。\r\n每到这个时节，父母年年都会\r\n面露难色……就像现在的你一样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6e6d6d759b1ce3bb546aa4cff339f7f7c98377190873361699e18d2353fe73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e220122c673642a6b6634ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年嘛……我想想，我想要花。\r\n野花也无妨。……请告诉我，\r\n现在的你觉得什么花最美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d789353e7ce9efe9ec17f23cc20f1f833246a02f150d2e6a2e209dbd5c318d08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2c380ed4fd6ee90ae478e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那是自然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1f314746552184897439de9c8c0473065d97f64cabf90ef920441fc7ec3364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8416222752dc51f4f830ae4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当开始扫除道场上的积灰，\r\n就能深切感受到年末将至呢。……那么，\r\n接下来该扫除训练员室的积灰了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8802b29c630f512bb7d6a61be1c00d092bbbf5baa11549801d338032df8196d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c6a653816d653d5467dca13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭贺生辰之喜。……今年\r\n也能这般为你庆生，我感到很高兴。\r\n愿你安康。无论到何时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3b19e68099051729c5fc30d539eea48ebed2b87903579cea5907598c5efda4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae302713b1dc395106f8c0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早点把工作收尾，\r\n去休息吧。……今天是你的生日吧。\r\n至少在这样的日子，多犒劳一下自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e652c3754a4d2c4ec27fa4e8d71391443f7e4fc279c42beedce3f3d63e98f182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea85dda89182a1601661b008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物吗……既然如此，\r\n就把时间分出来用于自我锻炼吧。\r\n你的成长，就是最好的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b60e16c52c57c5c5ba743c0d641a5dcabeff21ef4190fa7e40a6300882499e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a91cf2109364d896f4e6151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够遇见你这位同志，\r\n我已别无所求。\r\n……什么，非要我想一个？……这可难办了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f7c556c236c635a614877de553371028017e8edff2990d7e570db9404670fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609d492611d21f87c34a8345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了。\r\n记得尽早过目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e2fb16f665b3fdc327f30e7cb8dbb42895f2d2ce2cb86886f7a551e9b45097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac4790ffab97fda465e2b077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "礼物寄到了。\r\n这份厚意，就让我们郑重收下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb5861c80d40349a43f57269511d51d6a39d3f3508f35baa555b834589c7f5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70e175b4594075ae4b90f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成了。\r\n干得好。下次也要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fbdb17155b86c9c63004c90b441bfd7d617cbb90e05218df6ee3133beae0399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce88110964853bd0effdfb75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近期似乎有活动。\r\n若有机会，要去露个面吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "62218f809ded6d2f33ca28a2c70ceed2e3429b12d3eab1d52fd19532b39396a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e02c9a13d2d2e3113e113c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中。\r\n如果是你的话，定能取得好成绩。\r\n带着自信去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096c8ce15737864c35d7f7d902482c59f53f28887f76724acbe88bef1efc3d74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88468217b6dbe4aea5341ac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……只有一线之隔吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a03563e812a489f4c8bf7b5a2883f7d9e12bf9093d083401323081096bcd1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9791a874dd0a6c9b6d015afb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级似乎提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa58b8d9d676ccdff6f319a973a696a186cfc24e60d1b2b6c0b0b1c0e4c058b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827351a46b1614289dc1e6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想挑便于调节体温的衣服……\r\n但有时也会仅凭设计来选择。\r\n就像这件一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7254e3b4d0caca1881fbdd8c2d30d8179d603f95f57ebf1fc7f1440a3cf1eb58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62b5f131212a70e3f8cb5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家似乎总觉得我平时\r\n只穿和服。所以我穿这身衣服时，\r\n大多会让人吃一惊……呵，真愉快啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8799ee4ce05dc7bb4f09c634d5b9895fab8bf6e46ebccd7c6db438719178dffc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a9d07760945e3f6788920f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……毛皮是不是有些塌了？\r\n单靠梳理已经到极限了吗……\r\n最近还得再拿去保养一下啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27bd642db9c72d919514c5f7da79419b2ab8e4dff3153060d3cb0a4124e6674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bacc212efc7c45ae55fc4df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，干得不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b1bcb8e755314b80b629da17b4adbeb29b96d15535f443bf1cbffb0231054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02678d8821598ec110cfc8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奏响胜利的凯歌吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b2f0a82a3bbd9dfdc16aabf933bf11307a25fa72d41d3f83e1e5cd5c52b342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce6ae4772cd59696f280ff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……只有一线之隔吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a03563e812a489f4c8bf7b5a2883f7d9e12bf9093d083401323081096bcd1bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2b427511cf05e6a32e8fa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，干得不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b1bcb8e755314b80b629da17b4adbeb29b96d15535f443bf1cbffb0231054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f59388636262ca1c9ebf8e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身手见长啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e6a28921e125ca2e9f526a66d7298bafc57a069b7cf77db5036f33afa40c194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d343aef290070dfc799f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下，那名为胜利的大轮之花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6e3948b0adb7b8ad6481d8d6bb055b546fa38cc2d12a0b583e097b4a8088ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b03844a0f47dad7cb2833b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37434d908f1b2837eb08ce09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。锻炼\r\n正是那促使开花的慈雨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f024c2f24767560a1584c1936e59f525746c571a35f42bc7798d8fe0d0fa871e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a21201a730acd0330e7afe1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是发芽还是绽放之姿，都是千姿百态的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09318ee736f0c53ea8c07003d2c7fe2f7abea2feb945ab278763c82fcf484289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1149",
